Input type: {image_type}
When the input type is GIF, the image is distinct frames of an animation laid out left to right in time order; describe the content and how it changes. When it is STATIC, the image is a single still picture.
Describe the content of this image in English. If there is text, summarize the text. Pay attention to its topic and immediate impression. Output one plain-text paragraph within 30 words. Do not use bullet points.
